+++ b/src/biscuit/kotoba.cljc
@@ -45,10 +45,26 @@
   -> `{:grants [{:grant/kind :grant/resources :grant/expires :grant/id} …]
        :grant/rejected [...]}`
 
-  Facts read: `[cap <kind> <resource>]` and `[before <instant>]`. Everything
-  else stays available to checks and policies and confers nothing — the same
-  one-directional ignorance `biscuit.authority` documents, for the same
-  reason: **an unread fact cannot widen a grant.**
+  Facts read: `[cap <kind> <resource>]`, `[before <instant>]` and
+  `[holder <principal>]`. Everything else stays available to checks and
+  policies and confers nothing — the same one-directional ignorance
+  `biscuit.authority` documents, for the same reason: **an unread fact
+  cannot widen a grant.**
+
+  ## The holder fact is read here because not reading it was not neutral
+
+  `holder` was the one fact whose omission did not fail toward less
+  authority. A token saying `[holder \"did:key:zAlice\"]` is a token its
+  issuer addressed; dropping the fact turned it back into a bearer token,
+  and `biscuit.effective` then filled `:cap/holder` from the **request** —
+  that is, from whatever the caller asserted about itself. The claim and
+  the check were on the same side.
+
+  The effective holder is the **last** holder fact in block order, not the
+  first. `authority.grant/meet` states the rule this follows: *the holder is
+  the child's: a delegation ends at whoever holds the leaf.* A chain whose
+  authority block is addressed to Alice and whose block 1 re-addresses it to
+  Bob is Alice delegating to Bob, and it is Bob who presents it.
 
   Blocks fold in order and later blocks may only remove resources from a kind
   they already have, never add a kind — `:scope-attenuation-only true` is not
@@ -79,14 +95,16 @@
                                                 [k (set/intersection rs later)]))
                                             acc)))))
                        {} per-block)
-        befores (keep (fn [[p v]] (when (= 'before p) v))
-                      (mapcat :block/facts blocks))
-        expires (when (seq befores) (reduce (fn [a b] (if (neg? (compare a b)) a b)) befores))]
+        all-facts (mapcat :block/facts blocks)
+        befores (keep (fn [[p v]] (when (= 'before p) v)) all-facts)
+        expires (when (seq befores) (reduce (fn [a b] (if (neg? (compare a b)) a b)) befores))
+        holder (last (keep (fn [[p v]] (when (and (= 'holder p) (string? v)) v)) all-facts))]
     {:grants (vec (for [[k rs] folded]
                     (cond-> {:grant/kind k
                              :grant/resources (vec (sort rs))
                              :grant/id (str "biscuit:" (hash [k (sort rs)]))}
-                      expires (assoc :grant/expires expires))))
+                      expires (assoc :grant/expires expires)
+                      holder (assoc :grant/holder holder))))
      :grant/rejected @rejected}))
 
